# Opinion

Meeting: 0025-configure-oidc-fallback-and-registration
Agent: ArchitectA
Task: configure oidc fallback and registration
Context:
- Remote sync relies on OIDC; missing config was blocking usability.
- Local basic auth fallback allows single-page use while keeping remote sync disabled.
Position:
- Accept a local-only path when OIDC is absent, but make it clear sync is offline.
Recommendations:
- Keep OIDC enforcement for remote sync strict.
- Highlight the fallback in deployment notes so operators know to configure OIDC in production.
